    {
      "bbox": [
        660,
        454,
        1593,
        500
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, The New York City Charter empowers and charges the Mayor with the\nresponsibility of administering the Expense Budget for the 1974-1975 fiscal year, and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2597,
          "min": -1.2375
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 40,
          "mean": -0.0036,
          "min": -0.1328
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 9147,
        "area_px": 40608,
        "density": 0.22525,
        "chars": 160,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 17.49
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        660,
        500,
        1593,
        590
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, Certain itemized information and supporting schedules of appropriations, as\nlast modified as of February 15, 1974, were contained in the Mayor's 1974-1975 Budget\nMessage, in accordance with Section 117(b)2 of the New York City Charter, and it is\nnecessary to provide for certain actions taken subsequent to February 15, 1974.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2055,
          "min": -0.9697
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 92,
          "mean": -0.0059,
          "min": -0.5239
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 17838,
        "area_px": 78624,
        "density": 0.22688,
        "chars": 334,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 18.72
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        658,
        595,
        1593,
        640
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Now, therefore, in order to carry out and provide for an effective administration of\nthe 1974-1975 Expense Budget, it is hereby ordered as follows:",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.217,
          "min": -1.0022
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0003,
          "min": -0.0003
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 38,
          "mean": -0.001,
          "min": -0.0346
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 7564,
        "area_px": 39836,
        "density": 0.18988,
        "chars": 147,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 19.43
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        660,
        646,
        1591,
        690
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. The budget appropriations of all departments and agencies shall be ad-\nministered during the fiscal year 1974-1975 under the terms of this Executive Order.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2197,
          "min": -1.0624
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0048,
          "min": -0.0048
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 42,
          "mean": -0.0045,
          "min": -0.0986
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 8642,
        "area_px": 38880,
        "density": 0.22227,
        "chars": 166,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 19.21
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        660,
        696,
        1591,
        786
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\u00a7 2. The term \"Agency\" as used in this Executive Order means any office, adminis-\ntration, department, division, board, bureau, commission, corporation, institution or other\nunit of government, the expenses of which are paid in whole or in part from the City\nTreasury.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.1831,
          "min": -1.0424
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0803,
          "min": -0.0803
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 64,
          "mean": -0.0032,
          "min": -0.0708
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 12628,
        "area_px": 78624,
        "density": 0.16061,
        "chars": 268,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 21.22
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        660,
        791,
        1593,
        880
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\u00a7 3. Schedules of the appropriations contained in the Mayor's Message which accom-\npanied the Executive Budget, or of such appropriations as amended by the City Council\nand Board of Estimate in adopting the Expense Budget for the 1974-1975 fiscal year are\nhereby approved.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.1998,
          "min": -0.8918
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 64,
          "mean": -0.0052,
          "min": -0.2522
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 14170,
        "area_px": 77760,
        "density": 0.18223,
        "chars": 272,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 19.2
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        660,
        884,
        1593,
        952
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\u00a7 4. (a) All actions taken in accordance with the New York City Charter, subsequent\nto February 15, 1974, approving modifications of the supporting schedules as contained\nin the Mayor's 1974-1975 Budget Message are hereby carried over, effective July 1, 1974.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2076,
          "min": -1.1306
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0003,
          "min": -0.0003
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 75,
          "mean": -0.0075,
          "min": -0.4825
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 13196,
        "area_px": 59616,
        "density": 0.22135,
        "chars": 259,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 19.63
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        660,
        952,
        1593,
        1019
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "(b) All adjustment of rates of positions in accordance with the provisions of special pay plans or reallocations, effective but not implemented prior to June 30, 1974, are hereby included in the 1974-1975 Budget, effective July 1, 1974.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.1538,
          "min": -0.8478
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.043,
          "min": -0.043
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 67,
          "mean": -0.0063,
          "min": -0.3872
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 11727,
        "area_px": 58752,
        "density": 0.1996,
        "chars": 236,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 20.12
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        662,
        1024,
        1595,
        1335
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\u00a7 5. All of the powers of budget modification, as granted in Section 124(a) of the\nNew York City Charter are hereby withdrawn from all agencies except for the follow-\ning: the Boards of Education and Higher Education, the Community Colleges, the Offices\nof the Borough Presidents, the Comptroller, the Board of Elections, the District Attorneys,\nthe President of the City Council, the City Council, Health Services Administration,\nTransportation Administration, Human Resources Program, Addiction Services Agency,\nFinance Administration, Municipal Services Administration, Environmental Protection\nAdministration, Parks, Recreation and Cultural Affairs Administration, Police Depart-\nment, Fire Department, Economic Development Administration, Department of Social\nServices and Youth Services Agency; provided that the Mayor may, as a condition of mak-\ning these exceptions, require these agencies to cooperate with the Bureau of the Budget\nin realizing savings required to meet potential budget deficits that may arise during the\nfiscal year, and to conform to the terms of certificates governing the apportionment of\nPersonal Service budget appropriations during the fiscal year.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1908,
          "min": -1.1356
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0002,
          "min": -0.0002
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 221,
          "mean": -0.0029,
          "min": -0.5274
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 60138,
        "area_px": 269806,
        "density": 0.22289,
        "chars": 1181,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 19.64
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        664,
        1340,
        1595,
        1407
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\u00a7 6. Those agencies not specifically excepted from the provisions of Section 5 herein,\nproviding for the withdrawal of the power of budget modifications, shall be governed by\nthe following special terms and conditions in the administration of budget appropriations:",
      "logprob_stats": {
