      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        710,
        1621,
        1597,
        1751
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "(3) A monthly report shall be sent to the Bureau of the Budget, stating the number of positions in the agency, the number filled, the number of vacancies (both regular and leave of absence), the number pending establishment, and the position each agency expects to fill. Accompanying this report should be a list of vacancies by code and line number, title, schedule line rates, and the rate at which the position will be filled.",
